  "idea": "Penpot: the free open-source Figma alternative for design teams",
  "text": "Figma pricing is getting out of hand, so try this free open-source alternative. Adding developers and clients to design files triggers expensive seat fees that drain agency margins. Restricting team access forces developers to build interfaces from outdated static screenshots. Instead, switch to Penpot, an open-source design platform built on web standards with zero seat fees. You collaborate seamlessly with unlimited teammates while eliminating software overhead.",
